00:03:18.615 --> 00:03:20.700
- You know, the action in the playoff, 

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.952
when you went down, you remember?

00:03:22.952 --> 00:03:23.369
- Yeah, yeah.

00:03:23.369 --> 00:03:25.205
- What did you feel about it in that moment?

00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:28.750
- I just really, I mean, I feel like my whole basketball life flashed before my eyes. 

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:32.337
I thought about everything I did from, like, the first time I played until then.

00:03:32.337 --> 00:03:33.213
You know what I’m sayin’? 

