00:03:57.987 --> 00:03:59.614
it’s, like, it’s kinda serious.”

00:03:59.614 --> 00:04:00.698
- Yeah, man. That’s—

00:04:00.698 --> 00:04:03.534
first of all, when you, when you switched out on me, man,

00:04:03.534 --> 00:04:05.370
I was like, “Why would y’all switch Serge out on me?”

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:08.081
“Even though I’m a little hobbled right now, this a bucket!”

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:09.415
