00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:18.007
- Yeah, and uh—

00:04:18.007 --> 00:04:18.716
- Gonna cook that!

00:04:18.716 --> 00:04:21.719
- And it’s crazy how fast your mind switch, cuz in a matter of the next second,

00:04:21.719 --> 00:04:25.098
it was like I was on the ground thinkin’ about my whole basketball career, 

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:26.432
so I was just like, “Pshhh.”

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:30.228
It happened so fast, and once I got back to the back and realized

00:04:30.228 --> 00:04:34.190
what happened, I was just like, 
“All right, man. Lemme figure out—when can I get surgery?” 

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:34.816
You know what I’m sayin’?

00:04:34.816 --> 00:04:35.108
