00:04:49.497 --> 00:04:50.707
- Nah, it’s all a part of the game, man.

00:04:50.707 --> 00:04:54.335
- You know, I know. I saw a copy of an interview where you, you

00:04:54.335 --> 00:04:56.671
- Nah, that was all jokes. 
