it was like a college atmosphere there.

00:05:12.979 --> 00:05:13.688
- They was excited, yeah. They were just excited, yeah.

00:05:13.688 --> 00:05:15.106
- So, like, I understood. There wasn’t no hard feelings,

00:05:15.106 --> 00:05:18.067
