00:07:07.802 --> 00:07:10.430
and, like, when you won it, everybody was respecting you, right?

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:10.972
- You right, you right.

00:07:10.972 --> 00:07:14.308
- So now we are the actual champ, so put some respect on our name.

00:07:14.308 --> 00:07:15.726
- You right, you right.

00:07:15.726 --> 00:07:16.144
- Right?

00:07:16.144 --> 00:07:16.936
- You 100 percent right on that. 

