00:07:19.105 --> 00:07:22.066
- That’s different. I respect the fans, but the Warriors fans is better.

00:07:22.066 --> 00:07:23.025
- Why’d you leave then?

00:07:23.025 --> 00:07:26.320
- I mean, it was another opportunity for me to play for another team.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:28.364
It wasn’t, it wasn’t that big of a deal.

00:07:28.364 --> 00:07:30.867
You know what I’m sayin’? It was just like, “I wanna play for the Nets.”

00:07:30.867 --> 00:07:33.327
It was on the East Coast, close to home.

00:07:33.327 --> 00:07:35.872
The Nets are solid, and it’s New York City. 

00:07:35.872 --> 00:07:39.876
I could pick my game up and play anywhere, so I just did it.

00:07:39.876 --> 00:07:42.712
- Why did you choose Brooklyn? Why not the Knicks? 

00:07:42.712 --> 00:07:44.338
It could be the Knicks too, you know.
