00:07:44.338 --> 00:07:47.425
- Cuz it’s New York, big city. Why you choose Brooklyn?

00:07:47.425 --> 00:07:51.095
- I just liked the organization as far as just the direction they were goin’ in, 

00:07:51.095 --> 00:07:53.681
a bunch of young guys that had played in the playoffs before. You know, 

00:07:53.681 --> 00:07:56.476
I think the Knicks players, they’re good young players, 

00:07:56.476 --> 00:07:59.729
but they still need a little bit more 
experience to match where I was in my career.

