00:08:14.035 --> 00:08:16.913
and then bein’ around Kyrie, you know, it’s the same thing.

00:08:16.913 --> 00:08:21.292
The standard that a point guard sets every 
day is what kinda leads the team, you know? 

00:08:21.292 --> 00:08:24.754
So I’m excited to play alongside him and see, see where we go.

00:08:24.754 --> 00:08:27.757
- What was the hardest decision to make: 

00:08:27.757 --> 00:08:31.552
leaving OKC to Warriors or leaving Warriors to come here?

00:08:31.552 --> 00:08:34.347
