00:08:38.017 --> 00:08:41.312
I done bought houses and did everything there, you know what I’m sayin’?

00:08:41.312 --> 00:08:46.192
Like, grew up as it—in my 20s. So it was hard to leave that place and leave,

00:08:46.192 --> 00:08:47.652
like, all the equipment guys—

00:08:47.693 --> 00:08:51.280
everybody there, the support staff, and obviously my teammates. 

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:54.867
Well, they understood. I felt—
I figured y’all would understand cuz that’s just business,

00:08:54.867 --> 00:09:00.414
but, like, the other people, I felt a way about, 
and it took me a while to make the decision.

00:09:01.457 --> 00:09:04.168
- Who was the best shooter on the Warriors?

00:09:04.168 --> 00:09:04.835
- Who the best?

00:09:04.835 --> 00:09:05.711
- Yeah, shooter.

00:09:05.795 --> 00:09:06.504
